(present along roughly 1.8 miles of Jackson Creek in unit JC-04; yellow star-thistle is) Tj T*
(scattered along NFSR 15S04.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Recommendations: flag a 100-foot avoidance buffer around the SP-01 occurrence; clean) Tj T*
(equipment before entering units; schedule invasive removal before seed set.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
